GTWY AI frontend: Next.js 15 App Router (client components), React 19, Redux Toolkit + redux-persist, Axios, Tailwind v4 + DaisyUI 5, plain JavaScript.

- Start from AGENTS.md; details live in docs/ai/ (ARCHITECTURE, COMPONENTS, UTILITIES, DATA_MODEL, CONVENTIONS, GLOSSARY).
- Design and embed rules: docs/AI_INSTRUCTIONS.md.
- "bridge" in code = agent. Don't rename bridge* symbols or misspelled files and slices.
- No tests exist. Verify with `npm run lint` and `npm run build`.
- If a request is ambiguous, ask before coding.
- After adding a route, slice, API client, env var, hook or convention, update docs/ai/.
